<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">Finally, <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s official website, <STRONG><A 
href="http://www.madonna.com/" target=_blank>Madonna.com</A></STRONG>, has 
reveal the surprise. There were so much expectation and trepidation. Everybody 
was waiting for today... waiting for an announcement by <STRONG><A 
href="http://www.madonna.com/" target=_blank>Madonna.com</A></STRONG>. We are 
quite sure that everybody - even those whom were wainting for bigger news - 
would be satisfied. <BR><BR><EM>"Music, Love, Fashion, Stardom. 
<STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s got something for her fans... and only for them: 
<STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> - <STRONG>'Nobody Knows Me'</STRONG>. 52 pages of 
success commented by an icon and her angels. Rare and unseen shoots - classic 
and exclusive quotes. This time again expect the unexpected!"</EM> <BR><BR>So... 
It was announced the release of a LIMITED EDITION book - <STRONG>"Nobody Knows 
Me"</STRONG> - of 52 pages with rare and unseen shoots and classic and exclusive 
quotes. It's commented by <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> and here "power girls". This 
time, it seems they know how to satisfy her fans. <BR>Enter <STRONG><A 
href="http://www.madonna.com/" target=_blank>Madonna.com</A></STRONG> to 
pre-order <STRONG>"Nobody Knows Me"</STRONG> and to see a teaser. It will be available for pre-order from Nov 25 to Dec 30. They will 
ship orders out in January.<BR><BR>
