<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=31"><img src="images/topics/nonsolomadonnna.gif" border="0" Alt="Non Solo Madonna" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><P class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-GB style="FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"><STRONG>Memoirs of a Geisha</STRONG> (one of Madonna's biggest inspiration during the Ray of Light period) will finally be turned into what is expected to be a beautifully complex picture.<?xml:namespace prefix = o /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-GB style="FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB">Its producers state that the long and difficult process of adapting the novel into a great script, proves that they’re not interested in rushing things and more interested in doing a great job.<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-GB style="FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN lang=EN-GB style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: IT; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><FONT size=2>After seven years of development, the movie looks set to go with <STRONG>Rob Marshall</STRONG> at the helm and <STRONG>Columbia</STRONG>, <STRONG>DreamWorks</STRONG> and <STRONG>Miramax</STRONG> co-producing the likely blockbuster...</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN lang=EN-GB style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: IT; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><FONT size=2><U>Read more</U></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN lang=EN-GB style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: IT; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">
<CENTER><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/images/MOAG/book.jpg" align=baseline border=0>&nbsp;<IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/images/MOAG/madonna.jpg" align=baseline border=0></SPAN></CENTER>
<P></P>
</font></div>
