<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=14"><img src="images/topics/musica.gif" border="0" Alt="Music" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><STRONG>Mtv Italy</STRONG> website states that <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> is 
rumoured to want to record a ballads album. Here's what they have 
written.<BR><BR>Rumours about <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> keep on coming. <BR>The 
<STRONG>"Remixed & Revisited"</STRONG> Ep is confirmed and will be released 
(in <STRONG>Italy</STRONG>) on November 25. It will feature 6 remixed and 
revisited songs plus a previously unreleased track. Now, it's rumoured that the 
<STRONG>Queen of Pop</STRONG> wants to record a brand new album very soon. 
<BR>This release could be the nth <STRONG>Maddy</STRONG>'s sound u-turn. Some 
unofficial sources state that she would like to record an acustic ballads album. 
This would reverse the <STRONG>"Ray Of Light"</STRONG> electronic u-turn. 
<BR>This is not official, but it would be very interesting if the world pop 
goddess become a folk singer. <br><br><b>Note:</b> <i>Source: <STRONG>MTV Italy</STRONG>. Info: <STRONG>Marcuzio</STRONG>.</i>

</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


